Every icon pack keeps its own licence beside its files:

  common/   Sonora window controls, Simple Icons brand marks (CC0 1.0), and
            Tabler Icons login marks (MIT, see common/TABLER-LICENSE)
  lucide/   Lucide (ISC)
  iconoir/  Iconoir (MIT)
  material/ Material Symbols Rounded (Apache 2.0)
  mingcute/ MingCute Icon 3.1.0 (Apache 2.0)
  phosphor/ Phosphor Icons 2.1.1, Regular (MIT)
  remix/    Remix Icon 4.8.0 (Apache 2.0)
  solar/    Solar Icon Set, Linear style (CC BY 4.0, attribution required)
  tabler/   Tabler Icons 3.35.0 (MIT)
